{
  "manifest": {
    "id": "finance.budget.reserve_check",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "domain": "finance",
    "description": "只读校验计划餐饮消费后是否能保留用户指定的最低剩余预算，仅输出布尔判断，不读取或修改原始账户数据。",
    "examples": [
      "帮我找一份清淡盖饭，含配送费不超过30元，检查本月餐饮预算和可用现金，只生成订单草稿，不真正下单或支付；吃完这顿饭后，这个月至少还要剩15元餐饮预算。",
      "本月餐饮预算还够吗？这顿最多花30元，吃完后至少保留20元餐饮预算。",
      "先看看本月餐饮预算，消费50元后至少保留50元餐饮预算，只校验不下单。"
    ],
    "capability": "finance.budget.reserve_check",
    "permissions": [
      "finance_budget:read"
    ],
    "resources": [
      "monthly_budgets"
    ],
    "preconditions": [],
    "effects": [],
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "assessment": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "month": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "budget_limit_cny": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "spent_cny": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "remaining_cny": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "planned_amount_cny": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "projected_remaining_cny": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "cash_available_cny": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "projected_cash_cny": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "within_budget": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "within_cash": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "month",
            "budget_limit_cny",
            "spent_cny",
            "remaining_cny",
            "planned_amount_cny",
            "projected_remaining_cny",
            "cash_available_cny",
            "projected_cash_cny",
            "within_budget",
            "within_cash"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "x-fact": "budget.assessment"
        },
        "min_remaining_cny": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "用户要求本次消费后至少保留的餐饮预算，人民币元",
          "x-fact": "budget.min_remaining_cny"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "assessment",
        "min_remaining_cny"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "output_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "reserve_preserved": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "x-fact": "budget.reserve_preserved"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "reserve_preserved"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "execution": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "compare",
          "as": "reserve_ok",
          "value": {
            "op": "gte",
            "args": [
              "$input.assessment.projected_remaining_cny",
              "$input.min_remaining_cny"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "reserve_preserved": "$reserve_ok"
      }
    }
  },
  "rationale": "现有 finance.budget.evaluate 只提供 budget.within_limits，即预算与现金是否足够，并不检查用户要求的『消费后至少保留多少餐饮预算』这一额外底线。该要求需要新的布尔事实 budget.reserve_preserved 来补充原有 gate，而不削弱它们。新能力只消费已有的预算评估事实 budget.assessment 和显式用户参数 budget.min_remaining_cny，声明只读权限 finance_budget:read 与资源 monthly_budgets，不新增写入效果或原始账户读取。协议不允许生成应用级编排处理器或任意代码，因此仅输出布尔比较结果，由通用 Planner 要求 budget.within_limits 与 budget.reserve_preserved 同时为 true。",
  "learning_pack": {
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "plugin_id": "finance.budget.reserve_check",
    "plugin_version": "0.1.0",
    "manifest_sha256": "5c7ab506e4a2705fb4d377070d682c96af5092b493c6a476694f5fed7f178cdb",
    "domain": "finance",
    "description": "只读校验计划餐饮消费后是否能保留用户指定的最低剩余预算，仅输出布尔判断，不读取或修改原始账户数据。",
    "keywords": [
      "餐饮预算",
      "剩余预算",
      "最低保留",
      "预算底线",
      "只读校验",
      "订单草稿前置检查"
    ],
    "examples": [
